      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eau_Claire%2C_Wisconsin",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Indie folk star Justin Vernon, born in Eau Claire, co‑curated the Eaux Claires Music & Arts Festival that drew national attention.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
